  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc23:3.1.16": "“A formal meeting of the community”, <i lang='pi' translate='no'>saṁvāsa</i>, is defined at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-bu-vb-pc69/en/brahmali#2.1.21'>Bu Pc 69:2.1.21</a>, as the observance-day ceremony, the invitation ceremony, or a legal procedure. ",
