  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc23:3.3.5": "That <i lang='pi' translate='no'>osāreti</i> must mean “recite” can be seen from <a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-bu-vb-pc4/en/brahmali#2.3.5'>Bu Pc 4:2.3.5</a> where there is no offense if <i lang='pi' translate='no'>osārentaṁ opāteti</i>, “he prompts one who is <i lang='pi' translate='no'>osārentaṁ</i>.” The difference between <i lang='pi' translate='no'>uddesaṁ deti</i> and <i lang='pi' translate='no'>osāreti</i> is not clear to me. ",
